<TD ALIGN="left" VALIGN="top"> <P ALIGN="left" STYLE=" margin-top:0pt ; margin-bottom:0pt; font-family:Times New Roman; font-size:10pt">Adjusted net income<SUP STYLE="font-size:75%; vertical-align:top">i</SUP> of $0.3&nbsp;million and
$7.7&nbsp;million for the three and nine months ended September&nbsp;30, 2024, respectively, a decrease of 91% for the 3 months&#146; period and an increase of 106% for the nine months&#146; period compared to the 2023 equivalent period.
</P></TD></TR></TABLE> <P STYLE="font-size:6pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt">&nbsp;</P>
<TABLE STYLE="BORDER-COLLAPSE:COLLAPSE; font-family:Times New Roman; font-size:10pt" BORDER="0" CELLPADDING="0" CELLSPACING="0" WIDTH="100%">
