<TD ALIGN="left" VALIGN="top"> <P ALIGN="left" STYLE=" margin-top:0pt ; margin-bottom:0pt; font-family:Times New Roman; font-size:10pt">Adjusted EBITDA<SUP STYLE="font-size:75%; vertical-align:top">i</SUP>&nbsp;of $13.5&nbsp;million for the nine
months ended September&nbsp;30, 2024, an increase of 92% as compared to the nine months ended September&nbsp;30, 2023. </P></TD></TR></TABLE>
 <p STYLE="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt ; font-size:8pt">&nbsp;</P> <P STYLE="margin-top:0pt; margin-bottom:0pt; font-size:10pt; font-family:Times New Roman" ALIGN="center">1 </P>

