$0.1&nbsp;million increase from $0.3&nbsp;million for the same period of last year, due to the increase in the calendar days of our fleet during the current period. </P></TD></TR></TABLE>
<P STYLE="font-size:6pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt">&nbsp;</P>
