<TD ALIGN="left" VALIGN="top"> <P ALIGN="left" STYLE=" margin-top:0pt ; margin-bottom:0pt; font-family:Times New Roman; font-size:10pt"><U>Adjusted Net Income</U> was $7.7&nbsp;million corresponding to an Adjusted EPS, basic of $1.06 for the nine
months ended September&nbsp;30, 2024 compared to adjusted net income of $3.7&nbsp;million, corresponding to an Adjusted EPS, basic of $76.72 for the same period in the last year. </P></TD></TR></TABLE>
<P STYLE="font-size:6pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt">&nbsp;</P>
<TABLE STYLE="BORDER-COLLAPSE:COLLAPSE; font-family:Times New Roman; font-size:10pt" BORDER="0" CELLPADDING="0" CELLSPACING="0" WIDTH="100%">
